{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N54ZdUhG3gbS3W4dmLLqvr","type":"tool_result","content":"# slugify changelog\n\n## 2.0.0\n\nBreaking:\n- `slugify(text, separator)` is now `slugify(text, options)`. Passing a string as the second argument is no longer supported.\n- Lowercasing is opt-in: pass `{ lower: true }`. 1.x always lowercased.\n- The default separator is `_` (was `-`).\n\nAdded:\n- `strict: true` drops every character that is not a letter or a digit instead of turning runs of them into a separator.\n\n## 1.4.2\n\n- Combining marks are stripped after NFKD normalisation, so accented letters become their base letter.\n# vendor\n\nExact copies of upstream releases, one directory per package, with the upstream CHANGELOG. Update by re-vendoring the next release; never patch a vendored file in place, the next re-vendor would silently drop the patch.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"090aa593-3790-43ab-9572-dd5bbff58da5","uuid":"c66049b4-afe3-4ad1-b82f-7cb19122e8ed","timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:44:13.344Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# slugify changelog\n\n## 2.0.0\n\nBreaking:\n- `slugify(text, separator)` is now `slugify(text, options)`. Passing a string as the second argument is no longer supported.\n- Lowercasing is opt-in: pass `{ lower: true }`. 1.x always lowercased.\n- The default separator is `_` (was `-`).\n\nAdded:\n- `strict: true` drops every character that is not a letter or a digit instead of turning runs of them into a separator.\n\n## 1.4.2\n\n- Combining marks are stripped after NFKD normalisation, so accented letters become their base letter.\n# vendor\n\nExact copies of upstream releases, one directory per package, with the upstream CHANGELOG. Update by re-vendoring the next release; never patch a vendored file in place, the next re-vendor would silently drop the patch.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
